  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": 2025200,
      "startingMessageId": [
        202520000
      ],
      "messages": {
        "202520000": {
          "id": 202520000,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "On my way to the Xianzhou, I made sure to hit every collab store for <i>The Foxy vs. The Fluffy</i>.",
          "next": [
            202520001
          ]
        },
        "202520001": {
          "id": 202520001,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Badges, character stands, figures, sunscreen, power banks, robot vacuums. I've got them ALL!",
          "next": [
            202520002,
            202520003
          ]
        },
        "202520002": {
          "id": 202520002,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "This is the Fluffy Police speaking. Evanefox, what's gotten into you? Have you fallen out of love with <i>The Fluffy</i>?",
          "next": [
            202520005
          ]
        },
        "202520003": {
          "id": 202520003,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "<i>The Foxy vs. The Fluffy</i>? Is that even authorized?",
          "next": [
            202520004
          ]
        },
        "202520004": {
          "id": 202520004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "You bet! Word is that Blurry_QR_Colt personally gave the green light. \"<i>The Fluffy</i> is counting on all you amazing fan creators to keep it going!\"",
          "next": [
            202520005
          ]
        },
        "202520005": {
          "id": 202520005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "While <i>The Fluffy</i> is on hiatus, at least lemme have something to fill the void!",
          "next": [
            202520006
          ]
        },
        "202520006": {
          "id": 202520006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Though I may have gone a little aggressive on this... I bought way too much merch, and now I have no idea where to put it all.",
          "next": [
            202520007
          ]
        },
        "202520007": {
          "id": 202520007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Just when I was completely at a loss...",
          "next": [
            202520008
          ]
        },
        "202520008": {
          "id": 202520008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "It was the captain of The Foxy, Chillfox, who showed me the way!",
          "next": [
            202520009
          ]
        },
        "202520009": {
          "id": 202520009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "In Volume Two, Chillfox hid all the little foxes inside the \"Fridiculous Fridge\" and sneaked aboard The Fluffy by riding the food chain!",
          "next": [
            202520010
          ]
        },
        "202520010": {
          "id": 202520010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "What do you know... I had no idea you could store things other than food in a fridge.",
          "next": [
            202520011
          ]
        },
        "202520011": {
          "id": 202520011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "So I immediately placed an order for ten fridges from The Foxy collab and ten from The Fluffy collab.",
          "next": [
            202520012
          ]
        },
        "202520012": {
          "id": 202520012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "A cool home for my comics and merch that have nowhere else to go!",
          "next": [
            202520013,
            202520014
          ]
        },
        "202520013": {
          "id": 202520013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Watch out for the consumerism traps!",
          "next": [
            202520015
          ]
        },
        "202520014": {
          "id": 202520014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Do you even have that much stuff to put in them? Watch out for the consumerism traps, okay?",
          "next": [
            202520017
          ]
        },
        "202520015": {
          "id": 202520015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Wow, that was cold and heartless. Little raccoon, you've changed.",
          "next": [
            202520016
          ]
        },
        "202520016": {
          "id": 202520016,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "This isn't an impulse buy.",
          "next": [
            202520018
          ]
        },
        "202520017": {
          "id": 202520017,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Oh, I definitely do! This isn't an impulse buy.",
          "next": [
            202520018
          ]
        },
        "202520018": {
          "id": 202520018,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "One for the first-print editions, one for the collector's editions...",
          "next": [
            202520019
          ]
        },
        "202520019": {
          "id": 202520019,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "One for the must-have merch, one for the collab exclusives...",
          "next": [
            202520020
          ]
        },
        "202520020": {
          "id": 202520020,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "One for the virtual pets, and the other one's for... umm...",
          "next": [
            202520021,
            202520022,
            202520023
          ]
        },
        "202520021": {
          "id": 202520021,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Forget that. If you end up buying too many and have no use for them, just give them to me.",
          "next": [
            202520024
          ]
        },
        "202520022": {
          "id": 202520022,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "Never occurred to you to actually store food in it? Let the fridge be what it was meant to be!",
          "next": [
            202520025
          ]
        },
        "202520023": {
          "id": 202520023,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "Player",
          "senderContactId": 8001,
          "text": "The old wolf at the detective agency next door must be green with envy by now.",
          "next": [
            202520026
          ]
        },
        "202520024": {
          "id": 202520024,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Great idea! Actually, Chillfox's \"Fridiculous Fridge\" was ultimately claimed by The Fluffy, too.",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520025": {
          "id": 202520025,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Great idea! A fridge just for snacks!",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520026": {
          "id": 202520026,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Great idea! A fridge just for Detective Ashwolf!",
          "next": [
            202520027
          ]
        },
        "202520027": {
          "id": 202520027,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "And the rest goes to the Astral Express! It's settled.",
          "next": [
            202520028
          ]
        },
        "202520028": {
          "id": 202520028,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "See? Told you it'd come in handy~",
          "next": [
            202520029
          ]
        },
        "202520029": {
          "id": 202520029,
          "type": "Sticker",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "next": [
            202520030
          ]
        },
        "202520030": {
          "id": 202520030,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "The shipping form's all filled out. Don't forget to check your mailbox, little raccoon!",
          "next": [
            202520031
          ]
        },
        "202520031": {
          "id": 202520031,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1505,
          "text": "Problem solved. Now back to shopping! You have no idea how many Fluffy collabs are going on...",
          "next": []
        }
      },
      "participatingContactsIds": [
        1505,
        8001
      ]
    }
  ]
}